  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In some audit scenarios, it is important to prevent deletion of audit records.  To support this, investigate options for access control and/or disabling deletes in an external triplestore.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Fuseki does not appear to have builtin access control functionality (see ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://jena.apache.org/documentation/serving_data/#security-and-access-control),"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://jena.apache.org/documentation/serving_data/#security-and-access-control),",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " but Sesame uses a standard Java servlet container and so should support access control (see ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.rivuli-development.com/further-reading/sesame-cookbook/basic-security-with-http-authentication/)"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.rivuli-development.com/further-reading/sesame-cookbook/basic-security-with-http-authentication/)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ".",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
